<title>HONG KONG: SmarTone reaches 300,000 subscribers.</title>
<headline>SmarTone reaches 300,000 subscribers.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmarTone Telecommunications Holdings Ltd said on Sunday it had reached 300,000 subscribers ahead of the company's target date of December 1996.</p>
<p>The company said its subscriber base stood at 259,000 and 284,000, respectively, in September and October.</p>
<p>Monthly average revenue per subscriber rose to HK$589 in October from the quarterly average of HK$581 from July to September, it said.</p>
<p>SmarTone said its China Automatic Roaming Service had also attracted over 7,000 new customers within two months of launch.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
